@icon("users")
actors: section {
  | The people, programs and agents that use Heron or that Heron calls, and the personas behind
  | them.

  author: actor {{
    Someone who writes or changes a Heron tree: a spec, the kinds a package adds, data or tasks. This spec's
    own authors are authors too.
  }}

  implementer: actor(role = ActorRole.AGENT) {{
    An agent, or a person working the same way, that builds or changes part of the system
    from its spec alone: it loads one subtree and the surface of what it targets, and builds
    until the tests that prove the rules and scenarios of that subtree pass.
  }}

  reader: actor {{
    Someone who reads a tree's docs to use what the tree describes: to install it, run it
    and fix what goes wrong, without building it or reading its rules.
  }}

  reviewer: actor {{
    Someone who reads a change against the spec before it's accepted.
  }}
}
